# Cached raw HTML from crawled sites.
#
# NOT committed, for two reasons:
#   1. It is other people's content. Caching it locally to avoid re-fetching
#      is polite; republishing it in a public repo is a different act.
#   2. It is regenerable -- `crawler seed` rebuilds it -- and it is bulky
#      (~20 files, 15-45 KB each) with no review value.
#
# The cache still does its job locally: extraction can be re-tuned and the
# whole corpus re-scored without re-crawling.
data/raw/

# The generated report IS committed: it is the deliverable, and the numbers
# in the README point at it.
!data/reports/
